{"number":107,"nameArabic":"الماعون","nameTransliterated":"Al-Ma'un","nameTranslated":"The Small kindnesses","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":7,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"107:1","textAr":"أَرَءَيۡتَ ٱلَّذِي يُكَذِّبُ بِٱلدِّينِ","transliteration":"Araayta allathee yukaththibu bialddeeni","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Have you seen the one who denies the Recompense"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تم نے دیکھا اُس شخص کو جو آخرت کی جزا و سزا کو جھٹلاتا ہے؟"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"107:2","textAr":"فَذَٰلِكَ ٱلَّذِي يَدُعُّ ٱلۡيَتِيمَ","transliteration":"Fathalika allathee yaduAAAAu alyateema","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"For that is the one who drives away the orphan"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"وہی تو ہے جو یتیم کو دھکے دیتا ہے"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"107:3","textAr":"وَلَا يَحُضُّ عَلَىٰ طَعَامِ ٱلۡمِسۡكِينِ","transliteration":"Wala yahuddu AAala taAAami almiskeeni","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And does not encourage the feeding of the poor"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور مسکین کو کھانا دینے پر نہیں اکساتا"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"107:4","textAr":"فَوَيۡلٞ لِّلۡمُصَلِّينَ","transliteration":"Fawaylun lilmusalleena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So woe to those who pray"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر تباہی ہے اُن نماز پڑھنے والوں کے لیے"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"107:5","textAr":"ٱلَّذِينَ هُمۡ عَن صَلَاتِهِمۡ سَاهُونَ","transliteration":"Allatheena hum AAan salatihim sahoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[But] who are heedless of their prayer"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جو اپنی نماز سے غفلت برتتے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"107:6","textAr":"ٱلَّذِينَ هُمۡ يُرَآءُونَ","transliteration":"Allatheena hum yuraoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Those who make show [of their deeds]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جو ریا کاری کرتے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"107:7","textAr":"وَيَمۡنَعُونَ ٱلۡمَاعُونَ","transliteration":"WayamnaAAoona almaAAoona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And withhold [simple] assistance"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور معمولی ضرورت کی چیزیں (لوگوں کو) دینے سے گریز کرتے ہیں"}]}]}